    {
      "id": "5a346d1c-bff0-483a-a6dd-0021a487052f",
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## SEO Agent – 14 Daily Opportunities & Autopilot\nDaily: re-rank every opportunity (documented formula) → Next Best Action → if the project is at automation level 3/4, approve + deploy eligible LOW-risk fixes (never high/critical; daily cap; same backup/verify/rollback pipeline) → dispatch alerts.\n\nRequires n8n env vars: SEO_API_URL, SEO_API_KEY (service key), SEO_PROJECT_ID. All logic runs in the SEO Agent API; every call is retried 3× and failures trigger the Error Handler workflow.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 260
      },
      "name": "Note b8759b",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "31359508-94bb-43fa-a3fe-55b1dc4c468f",
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 7 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "name": "Every day 07:00 IST",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
